units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 58.6934
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
timestep 0.005
reset_timestep 0
velocity all create 600 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal vol
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 0.1 iso 1.01325 1.01325 1
run v_nsteps
